"Unavailable" = "無法取得";
"Verify or repair the model before starting the server." = "啟動 server 前，請先驗證或修復模型。";

"Prefill acceleration" = "Prefill 加速";
"Speeds up prompt processing. Requires layer-major prefill with MTP off. Changes apply on next load." = "加快提示詞處理。需要啟用 layer-major prefill，並關閉 MTP。變更會在下次載入模型時生效。";

"Keep recently used experts" = "保留最近使用的專家資料";

"Keeps recently used expert data in the same cache capacity. Changes apply on next load." = "在相同快取容量內，優先保留最近用過的專家資料。下次載入模型時生效。";

"Verify up to four tokens together" = "一次確認最多四個字詞";

"Reuses expert data when text repeats. Each token is checked by the model. Uses ordinary decoding with MTP, unsupported layouts, or a large state cache. Changes apply on next load." = "文字重複時重用專家資料，每個字詞仍由模型確認。啟用 MTP、格式不支援或狀態快取過大時，使用原本的生成方式。下次載入模型時生效。";

"Number of routed experts in the Active Parameters Cache. The recommended value is %lld." = "Active Parameters Cache 的 routed expert 數量。建議值是 %lld。";

"Prompt cache" = "提示快取";

"Off" = "不使用";

"Disk" = "磁碟";

"Memory reuses prompts until the model unloads. Disk also keeps them after restart. Off processes each prompt again." = "記憶體快取保留到模型卸載；磁碟快取可在重啟後重用；不使用則每次重新處理輸入。";

"Use adaptive sampling" = "使用自動適應";

"Chooses sampling values for chat or thinking. Turn off to use the values below." = "依一般對話或思考模式選擇參數。關閉後使用下方設定值。";

"Use approximate mode" = "使用近似模式";

"Off uses Exact mode. Approximate mode is not used with DSpark." = "關閉時使用 Exact 模式。啟用 DSpark 時不使用近似模式。";

"Expert cache eviction" = "專家快取淘汰方式";

"LRU keeps recently used experts. LFU keeps frequently used experts." = "LRU 保留最近使用的專家資料；LFU 保留使用次數較多的專家資料。";

"LRU (recently used)" = "LRU（最近使用）";

"LFU (frequently used)" = "LFU（使用次數）";

"Prefetch read workers" = "預讀工作數";

"Number of workers that read expert data ahead of time. The default is 2." = "提前讀取專家資料的工作數，預設為 2。";

"MoE prefill step size" = "MoE 輸入分批大小";

"Number of input tokens processed together by MoE. 0 selects automatically." = "MoE 每批一起處理的輸入 token 數。0 表示自動選擇。";

"Prefetch workers must be greater than 0. MoE prefill step size must be 0 or greater." = "預讀工作數必須大於 0；MoE 輸入分批大小必須為 0 或正整數。";

"Update source" = "更新來源";
"Stable includes official releases. Dev also includes test versions." = "Stable 提供正式版本，Dev 也包含測試版本。";
"Automatically check for updates" = "自動檢查更新";
"Check for new versions in the background." = "在背景檢查新版本。";

"Updates" = "更新";
